Description: graphical GTK4 frontend for bootc OS installation
 GTK4/Libadwaita graphical installer for bootc-based operating systems.
 Presents a step-by-step wizard covering disk selection, encryption,
 language, timezone, user creation, keyboard layout and network setup,
 then delegates the actual install to fisherman via pkexec.
 .
 The image catalog is configured via /etc/bootc-installer/recipe.json,
 which controls which OS images are offered, branding, and installer steps.
